+/-- The index types accepted for projected `Finset.Ico` sums: `Nat`, and the reducible aliases of `Nat`
+listed (one fully qualified name per line) in `LEAN4EXPORT_NAT_INDEX_ALIASES` (empty by default, so the
+projection is unchanged unless a configuration opts in; every projected theorem type is still checked
+`Meta.isDefEq` against the original before it is exported). -/
+def natIndexType (aliases : List Name) (t : Expr) : Bool :=
+  t.isConstOf ``Nat || (match t with | .const n [] => aliases.contains n | _ => false)
